' ============================================================================
' METADATA
'   author:       TheRobotDrafts Examples
'   description:  The TOGAF ADM wheel - phases A-H around a central Requirements mgmt hub.
'   usecase:      Teach the cyclic phase model and the central Requirements node.
'   complexity:   simple
'   domain:       enterprise / architecture-method
' ============================================================================
title Example TOGAF ADM - Simple ADM Cycle

' The ADM (Architecture Development Method) is a CYCLE, not a line.
' Phases A..H repeat each iteration. Requirements Mgmt sits at the CENTER
' and touches every phase.

note "Requirements Mgmt is central and continuous" as N1

' Central hub
usecase "Requirements\nManagement" as RM

' Phase nodes around the wheel
usecase "A: Architecture Vision" as A
usecase "B: Business Architecture" as B
usecase "C: Information Systems\nArchitectures" as C
usecase "D: Technology Architecture" as D
usecase "E: Opportunities & Solutions" as E
usecase "F: Migration Planning" as F
usecase "G: Implementation Governance" as G
usecase "H: Architecture Change\nManagement" as H

' Cyclic flow around the wheel
A --> B
B --> C
C --> D
D --> E
E --> F
F --> G
G --> H
H --> A : next iteration

' Central Requirements touches all phases
RM --> A : informs
RM --> B : informs
RM --> C : informs
RM --> D : informs
RM --> E : informs
RM --> F : informs
RM --> G : informs
RM --> H : informs
